    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a mysterious forest with no memories. Who are you, and why are you here? To uncover the truth hidden in this world, help the dolls with their troubles, gather ingredients, and craft special potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medi-Cooker\u00a0is a story-driven 2D platformer adventure</strong> set in a fairy tale-inspired world. Talk to dolls, solve their problems, and piece together the mysteries of both this world and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Explore a Storybook-Like World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/93ab853c76efad6c559eee5fabe07c7c.poster.avif?t=1754643027\" width=640 height=193 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/93ab853c76efad6c559eee5fabe07c7c.webm?t=1754643027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through forests, villages, caves, and other beautifully illustrated locations, each with its own unique atmosphere. With 11 original background tracks, immersive sound effects, and interactive objects scattered throughout the world, every place tells a story. Navigate these environments with simple jump and run mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf8 Meet Unique Dolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/99fb8543bba2ee7c8d87a90f04419176.poster.avif?t=1754643027\" width=640 height=193 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/99fb8543bba2ee7c8d87a90f04419176.webm?t=1754643027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dolls will come to you, each with their own problems and distinct personalities. Listen to their stories and choose how to help them\u2014your decisions shape how their troubles are resolved and influence the course of the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Gather Ingredients &amp; Make Potions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/37e2817d41a64e008fdb59a7fa7d92c6.poster.avif?t=1754643027\" width=640 height=193 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/37e2817d41a64e008fdb59a7fa7d92c6.webm?t=1754643027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various locations, interact with objects, and play mini-games to collect ingredients. In the witch\u2019s kitchen, prepare and refine your ingredients through point-and-click interactions, adding special components as needed. Once your potion is complete, give it to a doll and watch their reaction\u2014what will happen next? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game contains indirect references to sensitive topics, including suicide, which may be distressing to some players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a mysterious forest with no memories. Who are you, and why are you here? To uncover the truth hidden in this world, help the dolls with their troubles, gather ingredients, and craft special potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medi-Cooker\u00a0is a story-driven 2D platformer adventure</strong> set in a fairy tale-inspired world. Talk to dolls, solve their problems, and piece together the mysteries of both this world and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Explore a Storybook-Like World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/93ab853c76efad6c559eee5fabe07c7c.poster.avif?t=1754643027\" width=640 height=193 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/93ab853c76efad6c559eee5fabe07c7c.webm?t=1754643027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through forests, villages, caves, and other beautifully illustrated locations, each with its own unique atmosphere. With 11 original background tracks, immersive sound effects, and interactive objects scattered throughout the world, every place tells a story. Navigate these environments with simple jump and run mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf8 Meet Unique Dolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/99fb8543bba2ee7c8d87a90f04419176.poster.avif?t=1754643027\" width=640 height=193 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/99fb8543bba2ee7c8d87a90f04419176.webm?t=1754643027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dolls will come to you, each with their own problems and distinct personalities. Listen to their stories and choose how to help them\u2014your decisions shape how their troubles are resolved and influence the course of the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Gather Ingredients &amp; Make Potions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/37e2817d41a64e008fdb59a7fa7d92c6.poster.avif?t=1754643027\" width=640 height=193 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480030/extras/37e2817d41a64e008fdb59a7fa7d92c6.webm?t=1754643027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various locations, interact with objects, and play mini-games to collect ingredients. In the witch\u2019s kitchen, prepare and refine your ingredients through point-and-click interactions, adding special components as needed. Once your potion is complete, give it to a doll and watch their reaction\u2014what will happen next? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game contains indirect references to sensitive topics, including suicide, which may be distressing to some players.</p>",
